OL,3,GNEWSAFamily awarded Britain's best     
OL,4,AChristmas lights title                 
OL,6,FA family who have decorated their home 
OL,7,Fwith half a million lights say being   
OL,8,Fcrowned the winner of a Britain's best 
OL,9,FChristmas lights competition is a "real
OL,10,Fshock".                                
OL,12,FRoss and Michelle Clark, who live in   
OL,13,FBoughton-under-Blean near Faversham in 
OL,14,FKent, turned on their display on       
OL,15,FTuesday - the birthday of their son,   
OL,16,FJack, who died as a baby in 2002 after 
OL,17,Fbeing born prematurely.                
OL,19,FThe couple said their annual tradition 
OL,20,Fhad raised about #60,000 for charities 
OL,21,Fsince 2020 and it took "a lot of hard  
OL,22,Fwork" to pull off.                     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
