OL,3,GNEWSAFamily awarded Britain's best     
OL,4,AChristmas lights title                 
OL,6,FLove Actually star Martine McCutcheon, 
OL,7,Fwho judged the competition, said: "In a
OL,8,Ftime where so much is disposable and a 
OL,9,Fsense of community feels rare, I can't 
OL,10,Ftell you how heartwarming it is."      
